1
00:00:00,314 --> 00:00:01,484
Thank you, Sheldon.

2
00:00:02,483 --> 00:00:04,193
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

3
00:00:04,818 --> 00:00:08,238
Point of inquiry: Why did you
put your car key in the door lock?

4
00:00:08,405 --> 00:00:10,495
(Penny:)I'll tell you why.
Today I had an audition.

5
00:00:10,657 --> 00:00:13,577
(Penny:)It took me two hours to get there.
I waited an hour for my turn.

6
00:00:13,744 --> 00:00:16,914
Before I could start, they told me
I look too Midwest for the part.

7
00:00:17,081 --> 00:00:19,291
(Penny:)Too Midwest.
What the hell does that even mean?

8
00:00:19,458 --> 00:00:24,258
(Sheldon:)The American Midwest was mostly settled
by Scandinavian and Germanic peoples...

9
00:00:24,421 --> 00:00:27,131
- ...who have characteristic facial...
- I know what it means.

10
00:00:28,592 --> 00:00:31,342
God, I have been in L.A.
for almost two years now.

11
00:00:31,512 --> 00:00:34,682
I haven't gotten a single acting job.
I've accomplished nothing.

12
00:00:34,848 --> 00:00:37,938
(Penny:)Haven't gotten a raise at work.
Haven't even had sex in six months.

13
00:00:38,102 --> 00:00:43,062
And when I was walking up those stairs
a fly flew in my mouth and I ate it.

14
00:00:44,149 --> 00:00:47,029
(Sheldon:)Well, actually, insects are a dietary staple
in many cultures.

15
00:00:47,194 --> 00:00:48,524
(Sheldon:)They're almost pure protein.

16
00:00:49,613 --> 00:00:52,033
Oh, son of a bitch.

17
00:00:52,533 --> 00:00:54,573
(Sheldon:)The condensation on your frozen foods...

18
00:00:54,743 --> 00:01:01,023
(Sheldon:)...weakened the structural integrity
of the bag.

